<title>USA: CFI Mortgage names Don Lashbrook CFO.</title>
<headline>CFI Mortgage names Don Lashbrook CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CFI Mortgage Inc said Wednesday it has named Don Lashbrook to the newly created position of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Lashbrook previously served as vice president for risk management for Citizens Mortgage Corp in Atlanta.</p>
<p>Since its initial public offering of one million shares on May 28, CFI's stock has risen from $5 per share to $9.50.</p>
